  "metric": "fixed-budget (run_until_max) per-domain AUROC CI halfwidth + coverage of true AUROC; non-confounded (stop-at-\u03b4 was rejected: it forces both arms to CI\u2248\u03b4 by construction and confounds n_q with the adaptive selector).",
